Third-party material

Software dependencies are listed in Cargo.lock; their licences are in THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt
(`cargo xtask licences`), which the programs also carry (Help > About > Licences,
`solvecraft-cli licences`). The geometry kernel builds on the truck crates
(truck-modeling, truck-shapeops, truck-meshalgo, truck-stepio, truck-topology and their
dependencies, https://github.com/ricosjp/truck), licensed under the Apache License 2.0 and used
as libraries. truck-shapeops 0.4.0 is vendored in vendor/truck-shapeops with SolveCraft
modifications (listed in vendor/README.md and marked in the source); its licence is in
vendor/truck-shapeops/LICENSE. Copyright (c) RICOS Co. Ltd.

Some code is adapted from sibling projects in the storytold family (CADCraft, GridCraft), which are
licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0; ATTRIBUTION.md lists the files.

None of the bundled assets come from third parties: every icon is drawn in code. The per-file
list is in ATTRIBUTION.md.

